      "text": "  rule sortArrayLambda\n    => Lambda(\n         Params(\"value\"),\n         CellVars(.ParamNames),\n         FreeVars(.ParamNames),\n         IfExp(\n           Compare(Name(\"value\"), CmpOp(\"<\", Int(0))),\n           Int(0),\n           Call(\n             Attribute(Call(Name(\"bin\"), Name(\"value\")), \"count\"),\n             Str(\"1\"))))"
    },
